{"arm": "C", "case_id": "contract_0__q01", "case_set": "dev", "chunk_version": "8e5e8ba56765", "finding": {"answer": "All Cash", "evidence": [{"quote": "At the Effective Time, each share of Company Common Stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the Effective Time (other than Dissenting Shares and shares cancelled pursuant to Section 1.8(c)) shall be automatically converted into the right to receive, subject to and in accordance with Section 1.9, an amount of cash equal to the Per Share Cash Amount, without interest.", "section_ref": "Section 1.8(a)(i)"}, {"quote": "\"Per Share Cash Amount\" means $115.00 in cash per share of Company Common Stock.", "section_ref": "Section 1.1"}], "rationale": "Section 1.8(a)(i) converts each outstanding share of Company Common Stock into the right to receive cash equal to the Per Share Cash Amount, and Section 1.1 defines that amount as '$115.00 in cash per share.' Company options, RSUs, and PSUs are likewise cashed out (Section 1.8(a)(ii)-(iv)). No Parent stock is issued as merger consideration, so the consideration is entirely cash."}, "git_sha7": "4d2e361", "index_version": "e2b4a2b97561", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "question_id": "q01", "record": {"arm": "C", "case_id": "contract_0__q01", "chunk_version": "8e5e8ba56765", "failure_reason": null, "index_version": "e2b4a2b97561", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "status": "ANSWERED", "trajectory": [{"args": {"query": "Merger Consideration means"}, "char_ranges": [[4980, 6631], [238433, 240329], [6631, 6652], [13292, 15191], [233453, 235352]], "chunk_ids": ["contract_0:4980-6631", "contract_0:238433-240329", "contract_0:6631-6652", "contract_0:13292-15191", "contract_0:233453-235352"], "result_ref": null, "t_ms": 204, "tool": "search_agreement"}, {"args": {"query": "converted into the right to receive"}, "char_ranges": [[41558, 43452], [53178, 55077], [49858, 51752], [51518, 53416], [39898, 41793]], "chunk_ids": ["contract_0:41558-43452", "contract_0:53178-55077", "contr