{"arm": "C", "case_id": "contract_0__q03", "case_set": "dev", "chunk_version": "8e5e8ba56765", "finding": {"answer": "4 business days", "evidence": [{"quote": "the Company has provided to Parent at least four Business Days' prior written notice (a \"Notice of Superior Proposal\")", "section_ref": "Section 5.3(d)(iv)"}, {"quote": "Parent has not, within four Business Days of Parent's receipt of such Notice of Superior Proposal, made a written, binding and irrevocable (through the expiration of such four-Business Day period) offer that the Company Board has concluded in good faith (following consultation with its outside legal counsel and a financial advisor of national standing) to be at least as favorable to the Company's stockholders as such Superior Proposal", "section_ref": "Section 5.3(d)(vi)"}, {"quote": "the Company Board will not effect a Change of Recommendation and the Company will not terminate this Agreement pursuant to Section 7.1(h) for four Business", "section_ref": "Section 5.3(d)(vi)(B)"}], "rationale": "Section 5.3(d) gives Parent an initial four-Business-Day match period: the Company must give at least four Business Days' prior written Notice of Superior Proposal, and the Board may not effect a Change of Recommendation (or terminate under 7.1(h)) for four Business Days unless Parent fails within that period to make a binding offer at least as favorable as the Superior Proposal. (Subsequent revised proposals get a two-Business-Day window, but the initial period is four Business Days.)"}, "git_sha7": "4d2e361", "index_version": "e2b4a2b97561", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "question_id": "q03", "record": {"arm": "C", "case_id": "contract_0__q03", "chunk_version": "8e5e8ba56765", "failure_reason": null, "index_version": "e2b4a2b97561", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash", "status": "ANSWERED", "trajectory": [{"args": {"query": "match a competing proposal board change recommendation"}, "char_ranges": [[240093, 241992], [228473, 230366], [243413, 245313], [2